This contains useful scripts that help you save passwords by entering 
the level number and the password

These scripts were written soleely by me using this as reference bash scripting by 'yousuckatprogramming'.
[use chmod +x] to execute the following scripts.

I.Password filler:

#!/bin/bash

read -p "enter the number that the file file must be named" number
read -p "give me the password" content 

echo $content >> ./bandit$number

